OL,3,GNEWSALower rainfall means hosepipe ban
OL,4,Ato stay in place
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Thames Water area saw just over a
OL,7,Fthird of the rainfall between March and
OL,8,FSeptember recorded in the same period
OL,9,Ftwo years ago, the company has said.
OL,11,FThe Environment Agency declared a
OL,12,Fdrought across London and the Thames
OL,13,FValley 100 days ago on 29 July.
OL,15,FThames Water said while recent rain had
OL,16,F"helped some rivers and reservoirs
OL,17,Frecover... months of sustained rainfall
OL,18,Fare needed to rebuild supplies" so a
OL,19,Fhosepipe ban would remain in place.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
