OL,3,GNEWSALower rainfall means hosepipe ban
OL,4,Ato stay in place
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Tuesday, Farmoor Reservoir near
OL,7,FOxford was at 76% capacity and
OL,8,Freservoir storage across London stood
OL,9,Fat 56%.
